OL,3,AUK government rejects 'kill switch'
OL,4,Aidea for dangerous AI
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Blocking access to models in the UK
OL,7,Fwould not prevent them being developed
OL,8,For misused elsewhere", a spokesperson
OL,9,Ftold BBC News.
